  "description": "This rake is designed to last throughout the seasons. The all-steel construction coupled with a black rust-resistant coated finish ensures that rusting is not a problem. Enjoy continued use and dependability, no matter the weather.\nFitment\nGet ready for some heavy-duty landscaping with our landscape rake featuring 17 replaceable spring steel tines. These tines, standing tall at 13 inches, are your ultimate tool for clearing brush, prepping soil, raking horse arenas, dethatching lawns, and much more.\nFeatures\nSPRING STEEL TINES: This landscape rake features 17 replaceable spring steel tines, each standing at 13 inches tall, that can effectively clear brush, prep soil, rake horse arenas, dethatch lawns, and more.\n48\" Working Width: This rake covers more ground, making it efficient for landscaping tasks, and cutting down the time it takes to complete the job.\nRust Resistant Coating: All steel design plus black rust-resistant coated finishing prevents rusting for continued use throughout the seasons.\nExtensive Compatibility: Compatible with most ATVs/UTVs with 2-inch receivers; Easy assembly and professional installation are recommended.\nReliable Service: By choosing our sturdy Tractor Rake, improve productivity, and maximize accomplishments. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us by email and your questions will be answered within 24 hours. So order now.",
